{"id":"n74626-1-6","stage":5,"title":"저조 · 低落","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74626-1-6-1","ko":"이 노래는 들을 때마다 우울해지는 기분이야.","zh":"每次听这首歌，我都会觉得心情很低落。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"노래는","meaning":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","explanation":"노래：歌，歌曲，唱歌；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"노래","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20195","senseId":"1","lemma":"노래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노래는","audio":"/audio/06846fc90a74d02c0801.mp3"}},{"text":"들을","meaning":"听","explanation":"듣다：听；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"2","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들을","audio":"/audio/fd59edfe1d7db8276fb2.mp3"}},{"text":"때마다","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候；마다：表示“每、每逢”。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때마다","audio":"/audio/1e35b901eccff392fa42.mp3"}},{"text":"우울해지는","meaning":"忧郁；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"우울하다：忧郁；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"우울하다","audio":"/audio/9984229f0a2e336ca5be.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26654","senseId":"1","lemma":"우울하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우울해지는","audio":"/audio/9434763c8d70120cdbed.mp3"}},{"text":"기분이야.","meaning":"心情","explanation":"기분：心情；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"기분","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20192","senseId":"1","lemma":"기분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기분이야","audio":"/audio/0ac18b71ef9e868d274f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"edcad1c9c3dba9e9","term":"노래","zh":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3","entryId":"20195","definition":"给具有韵律的歌词添加曲子的音乐；或放声唱出那样的音乐。","pronunciation":["노래"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"聆听他人的话或声音等。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"9984229f0a2e336c","term":"우울하다","zh":"忧郁","audio":"/audio/9984229f0a2e336ca5be.mp3","entryId":"26654","definition":"因担忧等而内心郁闷、没有活力。","pronunciation":["우울하다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"ebafc4e98d6e15e7","term":"기분","zh":"心情","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3","entryId":"20192","definition":"不快、愉快、忧郁、愤怒等的情感状态。","pronunciation":["기분"]}],"audio":"/audio/d182d37ae743f00d925e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74626-1-6-2","ko":"저조의 노래라서 그런가 봐.","zh":"大概是这首歌的曲调太悲伤的缘故吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저조의","meaning":"低落","explanation":"저조：低落；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저조","audio":"/audio/ebf5c2ee87a885cedf08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74626","senseId":"1","lemma":"저조","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저조의","audio":"/audio/d4c27a184d49e873d91c.mp3